      "q": "7. A dealer wishes to purchase a number of fans and sewing machines. He has only Rs. 5760 to invest and has space for almost 20 items. A fan and sewing machine cost Rs. 360 and Rs. 240 respectively. He can sell a fan at a profit of Rs. 22 and sewing machine at a profit of Rs. 18. Assuming that he can sell whatever he buys, how should he invest his money to maximize his profit?",
