      "q": "13. If $A$ and $B$ are two events such that $P\\left( A \\right)=\\frac{1}{4}$, $P\\left( B \\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $P\\left( A\\cap B \\right)=\\frac{1}{8}$. Find $P$(not $A$ and not $B$).",
